# Optional. The game does not need any API key to run.
#
# AI features use, in order:
#   1. Chrome's built-in model (Prompt API), when it is already downloaded and available.
#   2. The player's own Gemini API key, entered in the game's settings (stored only in that browser).
#   3. A deterministic offline response when neither is available.
#
# Nothing in this file is read at build time. Do not put real keys in the build.
